OL,3,GNEWSAMan held after woman hurt in
OL,4,Athree-car M62 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving after a woman was seriously
OL,9,Finjured in a three-car crash on a
OL,10,Fmotorway.
OL,12,FA Mercedes van, a Volvo, and a Vauxhall
OL,13,FInsignia collided on the M62's
OL,14,Fwestbound carriageway near Rochdale at
OL,15,Fabout 22:00 BST on Saturday, Greater
OL,16,FManchester Police said.
OL,18,FThe force said the woman, in her 60s,
OL,19,Fwas in a "serious condition" in
OL,20,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
